# PHASE 7: PROJECT DOCUMENTATION

## Project Title

Import Data Using Transform Maps (Spreadsheet)

## Project Description

This project demonstrates how employee data can be imported from a spreadsheet into ServiceNow using Import Sets and Transform Maps.

## Technologies Used

* ServiceNow
* Import Sets
* Transform Maps
* Excel / Spreadsheet
* ServiceNow Reports
* ServiceNow Dashboards

## Main Components

1. Employee Test Table
2. Employee Import Table
3. Transform Map
4. Coalesce
5. Reports
6. Employee Analytics Dashboard

## Reports Created

* Employees by Department – Pie Chart
* Employees by Location – Bar Chart
* Employee List Report – List

The project document specifies these three reports and their configurations.

## Benefits

* Reduces manual data entry.
* Supports bulk employee data import.
* Helps prevent unnecessary duplicate records.
* Provides employee information through reports.
* Provides centralized visualization through a dashboard.

## Conclusion

The project demonstrates an end-to-end employee data import process in ServiceNow using Import Sets, Transform Maps and Coalesce, followed by reporting and dashboard visualization.

